      "cml:logicSummary": "Quorum requirement when a member cannot participate due to rules made under section 29 of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Overlaps",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) However, if: (a) rules made for the purposes of section 29 of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 prevent a member from participating in the deliberations, or decisions, of the ACMA with respect to a particular matter; and (b) when the member leaves the meeting concerned there is no longer a quorum present;"
    },
